  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Alma",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 44,
    "summary": "Moroni commands the Lamanites to make a covenant of peace or be destroyed—Zerahemnah rejects the offer, and the battle resumes—Moroni’s armies defeat the Lamanites. About 74–73 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they did stop and withdrew a pace from them. And Moroni said unto Zerahemnah: Behold, Zerahemnah, that we do not desire to be men of blood. Ye know that ye are in our hands, yet we do not desire to slay you.",
